            <ArticleTitle>Intracoronary fracture and embolization of a coronary angioplasty balloon catheter: retrieval by a simple technique.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>473-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a technique for retrieval of a balloon along with a portion of its shaft from the coronary system using a simple technique that does not involve the use of snare or any other retrieval tool. An additional angioplasty wire and a balloon catheter were used to remove the balloon from the coronary system.</AbstractText>
